    <code code="29545-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="Physical findings note"/>
    <title>Physical Exam</title>
    <text><paragraph>Vital signs recorded on 1939-06-29; see the Vital Signs section. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>General</td><td>Well; blood pressure 120/76, pulse 72; weight 88.4 kg</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Hand wasting slightly more marked; grip 4-/5 on both sides; left ankle dorsiflexion 4-/5; fasciculations in the arms and legs; reflexes brisk; tongue normal</td></tr><tr><td>Gait</td><td>Left foot slap; steady with a hand on the rail</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

